<title>FINLAND: Finnish 2004 bond yields 5.90 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>Finnish 2004 bond yields 5.90 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/93 bond was announced by the State Treasury Office  SUVL :</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-03-2004</p>
<p> COUPON:				 9.50 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			5.90 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  120.10</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 1,315 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 2,272 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>The previous auction of the bond raised 3,033 million markka at a price of 123.20 and a yield of 5.46 percent. After today's auction, the outstanding amount is 43,626 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
